turn, then move (5,0): (5, 0) (5, 2) (4, 2) (4, 0)
move (5,0), then turn: (0, 5) (0, 7) (-1, 7) (-1, 5)
turn about (2,1):      (3, -1) (3, 1) (2, 1) (2, -1)
pivot matrix [[0, -1, 3], [1, 0, -1], [0, 0, 1]]
then triple:           (9, -3) (9, 3) (6, 3) (6, -3)
four quarter turns give the identity: true
